# The vendored FDA recognition-list export is NOT committed by default.
#
# It is a bulk agency export superseded on every new FDA Recognition List, and
# keeping it out of git means a hand-written list of standards cannot arrive as
# an ordinary-looking commit. Committing it is a deliberate, reviewed asset
# acquisition (`git add -f`) that must carry the provenance block — see
# README.md "Vendoring policy".
fda-recognized-consensus-standards.json
*.json

# Everything else here IS committed.
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Guard: never let scratch/derived files ride along with an acquisition drop.
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
